// FSR 1 EASU (edge-adaptive spatial upsampling) for the window present (src/vk/present_fsr.c).
// One invocation per output pixel; 12 texel taps of the game's frame (texelFetch, no sampler filtering).
//
// A GLSL port of ffx_fsr1.h (AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0), following the WGSL port in SkyboundTOTK
// (a64-kit/gpu/render/rx_present_fx.cpp, MIT, Copyright 2026 NotRexed). Original license:
